    <statement><p>Determine whether the given vectors are <em> orthogonal</em>, <em> parallel</em>, or <em> neither</em>.</p>
<p><ul form="popup" name="AnSwEr0001"><li>
<p>choose one</p>
</li><li>
<p>Orthogonal</p>
</li><li>
<p>Parallel</p>
</li><li>
<p>Neither</p>
</li></ul> <alert> 1. </alert>  <m>\mathbf{v} = \langle 1,2,-1 \rangle</m> and <m>\mathbf{w} = \langle -11, -22, 11\rangle</m>.</p>
<p><ul form="popup" name="AnSwEr0002"><li>
<p>choose one</p>
</li><li>
<p>Orthogonal</p>
</li><li>
<p>Parallel</p>
</li><li>
<p>Neither</p>
</li></ul> <alert> 2. </alert>  <m>\mathbf{v} = \langle 2,11,14 \rangle</m> and <m>\mathbf{w} = \langle 11, -2, 0\rangle</m>.</p>
<p><ul form="popup" name="AnSwEr0003"><li>
<p>choose one</p>
</li><li>
<p>Orthogonal</p>
</li><li>
<p>Parallel</p>
</li><li>
<p>Neither</p>
</li></ul> <alert> 3. </alert>  <m>\mathbf{v} = \langle 11, 22, -33 \rangle</m> and <m>\mathbf{w} = \langle -33, 22, 11\rangle</m>.</p>
<p><alert> Note:</alert>  <em> You only have two attempts at this problem.</em></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\text{Parallel}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\text{Orthogonal}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\text{Neither}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
